  message: "Fixed in PR #689 (dev b8e4d675a1). extract_name_from_declaration now reads the grammar's 'name' field instead of the first identifier child. Behavioral evidence: live analyze_csharp probe — 'public WaveInfo Info => _info' now emits 'C.Info' (was 'C.WaveInfo'); 'public FeatureConfig Feat {get;set;}' emits 'C.Feat'; two same-typed properties (Feat/Other) no longer collide. Regression test: test_csharp.py::TestCSharpSpecialCases::test_user_typed_property_uses_member_name_not_type_name (asserts C.Info/C.Feat/C.Other present, C.WaveInfo/C.FeatureConfig absent, and qualified_name carries the member). No-op verified for class/interface/struct/enum/constructor. csharp.py at 100% coverage."  # 7cc3
